    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25917" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαστηματικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>proceeding by intervals,</i> of musical progressions, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κίνησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archyt.
					1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aristox.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				p.9
			</span></i> M., etc.; of Time, <i>measured by intervals,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>indicating distance,</i> of the pronoun <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκεῖνος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				57.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>dimensional,</i> opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδιάστατος, φύσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.184
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				110
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. φαντασία</span>
			<i>spatial</i> representation, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
			</span></i><i>in R.</i><i><span class="en">
				2.249K.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαστατικῶς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Epict.</u>
				p.5
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.663
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Syrian.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				24.22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοπικῶς καὶ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Ti.</u>
					2.104
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i></div>
